'use strict';

/**
 * SBC Training Management System V2
 *
 * Clean replacement for the legacy V15/V1 training runtime.
 * Durable state lives in db.settings.trainingCenterV2; this module never
 * relies on process-local Maps for student state, course state, or queues.
 *
 * Core rules:
 * - Learning is never gated by payment, Kim availability, or certification.
 * - Courses and versions can be draft, published, archived, or retired.
 * - Progress is a current snapshot PLUS append-only attempts/events/history.
 * - Failed assessments remain visible; retakes create new attempts.
 * - Owner/manager can inspect all employees and all historical training.
 * - Employees can see assigned/published role-appropriate learning and their own history.
 * - Certification is separate from completion and requires owner approval.
 */

